<title>UK: Electricite d' Emosson sets 75 mln Sfr 12-yr bond.</title>
<headline>Electricite d' Emosson sets 75 mln Sfr 12-yr bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following domestic bond was announced by lead manager UBS (Switzerland).</p>
<p> BORROWER   ELECTRICITE D' EMOSSON</p>
<p> AMT    75 MLN SFR    COUPON     4.25	MATURITY    30.JAN.09</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.75    PAY DATE    30.JAN.96</p>
<p> EOS	  09.DEC.96 LISTING    EBS	 DENOMS (K)  5</p>
<p> NOTES	CALLABLE AT PAR IN YEAR 10</p>
<p>		GLOBAL CERTIFICATE.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
